OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1785849528
OL,3,CDisposable barbecues banned at Kendal
OL,4,CCalling as preparations ramp up
OL,6,FAfter heatwaves and dry weather left
OL,7,Fgrass and fields across Cumbria
OL,8,Fvulnerable to fires, Kendal Calling
OL,9,Fhas banned the use of disposable and
OL,10,Fcharcoal barbecues at its site.
OL,12,FOver 40,000 people are expected to
OL,13,Fattend the festival, which is due to
OL,14,Fbegin on Thursday 30 July, and runs
OL,15,Fover the weekend at Lowther Deer Park.
OL,17,FIn a statement posted on Facebook,
OL,18,FKendal Calling organisers said that in
OL,19,Fthe deer park, "the grass (is) well
OL,20,Fand truly parched", adding, "some of
OL,21,Fthe grass looks closer to straw!"
OL,26,@{D@[pm{D@^pn
