OL,24,ANext Page BBorder NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,329,320,120,260,000,100
PN,32802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1785849528
OL,3,CDisposable barbecues banned at Kendal
OL,4,CCalling as preparations ramp up
OL,6,FOrganisers pointed out that while gas
OL,7,Fbarbecues - which are still permitted
OL,8,Fon site - can be turned off after use,
OL,9,F"disposable and charcoal BBQs can stay
OL,10,Fhot for hours and are much more likely
OL,11,Fto be left unattended".
OL,13,FGas barbecues can only be fuelled by
OL,14,Fgas canisters weighing less than 240g,
OL,15,Fhowever.
OL,17,FBlowtorches, Chinese lanterns,
OL,18,Fcampfires and fireworks are also
OL,19,Fforbidden during the festival.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G2/4
