PN,32803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1785849528
OL,3,CDisposable barbecues banned at Kendal
OL,4,CCalling as preparations ramp up
OL,6,FArtists like the Scissor Sisters,
OL,7,FBiffy Clyro, Wolf Alice and Two Door
OL,8,FCinema Club are headlining the event.
OL,10,FThose hoping to bring a camp chair to
OL,11,Fthe front of the stage to see these
OL,12,Facts will be left disappointed,
OL,13,Fhowever, as this year chairs and
OL,14,Fblankets will be allowed only behind
OL,15,Fthe sound tower of the main stage.
OL,17,FOrganisers said that "the Main Stage
OL,18,Fsits in a natural amphitheatre, so
OL,19,Fthere are still brilliant views
OL,20,Ffurther back".
